      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SST\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n| Data Blocks: sorted RocksDB internal key -> value      |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n| Index / Filter / other meta blocks                     |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n| Properties: built-in + TiKV user-collected properties  |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n| Metaindex                                              |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n| Footer: metaindex handle + index handle + magic        |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SST\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n| Data Blocks: sorted RocksDB internal key -> value      |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n| Index / Filter / other meta blocks                     |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n| Properties: built-in + TiKV user-collected properties  |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n| Metaindex                                              |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n| Footer: metaindex handle + index handle + magic        |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "iSv9DMabRkGQcVpJK5FmK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 295.31581190213626,
      "y": 833.9738803932333,
      "width": 783.1989135742188,
      "height": 1040,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b64",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1320724363,
      "version": 484,
      "versionNonce": 1467143333,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790649241394,
      "created": 1790649143354,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "                                          raw_user_key\n                                               |\n                                               | Key::from_raw()\n                                               v\n                              E = memcomparable(raw_user_key)\n                                               |\n                                               | MvccTxn selects CF and timestamp\nTiKV MVCC key                                  v\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| CF       | Logical key bytes                                                          |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| lock     | E                                                                          |\n| default  | E || desc(start_ts)                                                        |\n| write    | E || desc(commit_ts)                                                       |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n                                               |\n                                               | Modify -> raft_cmdpb::Request\n                                               | key bytes unchanged; no 0x7a prefix yet\nRaft command key                               v\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| CF       | Logical key bytes                                                          |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| lock     | E                                                                          |\n| default  | E || desc(start_ts)                                                        |\n| write    | E || desc(commit_ts)                                                       |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n                                               |\n                                               | Raft commit -> apply\n                                               | prepend DATA_PREFIX = 0x7a\nRocksDB user key                               v\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| CF       | Logical key bytes                                                          |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| lock     | 0x7a || E                                                                  |\n| default  | 0x7a || E || desc(start_ts)                                                |\n| write    | 0x7a || E || desc(commit_ts)                                               |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n                                               |\n                                               | RocksDB appends local tag\n                                               | tag = fixed64_le((seq << 8) | type)\nRocksDB InternalKey                            v\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| CF       | Logical key bytes                                                          |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| lock     | 0x7a || E || tag(seq,type)                                                 |\n| default  | 0x7a || E || desc(start_ts) || tag(seq,type)                               |\n| write    | 0x7a || E || desc(commit_ts) || tag(seq,type)                              |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n\nE             = memcomparable(raw_user_key)\ndesc(ts)      = big_endian(~ts)\ntag(seq,type) = fixed64_le((seq << 8) | type)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                                          raw_user_key\n                                               |\n                                               | Key::from_raw()\n                                               v\n                              E = memcomparable(raw_user_key)\n                                               |\n                                               | MvccTxn selects CF and timestamp\nTiKV MVCC key                                  v\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| CF       | Logical key bytes                                                          |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| lock     | E                                                                          |\n| default  | E || desc(start_ts)                                                        |\n| write    | E || desc(commit_ts)                                                       |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n                                               |\n                                               | Modify -> raft_cmdpb::Request\n                                               | key bytes unchanged; no 0x7a prefix yet\nRaft command key                               v\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| CF       | Logical key bytes                                                          |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| lock     | E                                                                          |\n| default  | E || desc(start_ts)                                                        |\n| write    | E || desc(commit_ts)                                                       |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n                                               |\n                                               | Raft commit -> apply\n                                               | prepend DATA_PREFIX = 0x7a\nRocksDB user key                               v\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| CF       | Logical key bytes                                                          |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| lock     | 0x7a || E                                                                  |\n| default  | 0x7a || E || desc(start_ts)                                                |\n| write    | 0x7a || E || desc(commit_ts)                                               |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n                                               |\n                                               | RocksDB appends local tag\n                                               | tag = fixed64_le((seq << 8) | type)\nRocksDB InternalKey                            v\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| CF       | Logical key bytes                                                          |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| lock     | 0x7a || E || tag(seq,type)                                                 |\n| default  | 0x7a || E || desc(start_ts) || tag(seq,type)                               |\n| write    | 0x7a || E || desc(commit_ts) || tag(seq,type)                              |\n+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n\nE             = memcomparable(raw_user_key)\ndesc(ts)      = big_endian(~ts)\ntag(seq,type) = fixed64_le((seq << 8) | type)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
