      "text": "raft log key\n+------+------+-------------------+------+-------------------+\n| 0x01 | 0x02 | region_id: u64 BE | 0x01 | log_index: u64 BE |\n+------+------+-------------------+------+-------------------+\n\nraft state key\n+------+------+-------------------+------+\n| 0x01 | 0x02 | region_id: u64 BE | 0x02 |\n+------+------+-------------------+------+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
